{"title":"고백! 파괴! 사랑!","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=bPbaSq/hAHInQ50Qy/XSlOZUreChiKCdydf80df0&filename=th3","synopsis":"“연애는 힘으로 쟁취하는 것, 강한 자만이 사랑할 수 있다!”\n\n이곳에선 나이, 성별 불문 강자만이 연애에 성공할 수 있다. \n모두 각자의 무기를 들고 다니며, \n학교에서도 사격과 무술을 가르친다. \n이 모든 것은 사랑을 위해!\n\n2학년 ‘가나연’은 우연한 계기로 \n3학년 선배 ‘전설’을 좋아하게 된다. \n\n하지만 전설은 그 누구도 고백을 성공시키지 못한 \n압도적 전투력을 가진 전교의 1등 남학생!\n\n나연은 학교최강인 전설을 쓰러뜨려 \n고백에 성공할 수 있을 것인가.\n\n*이것은 솔로 여러분들의 새로운 지침서*","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-09-13","rank":187,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-14","rank":237,"change":{"type":"down","amount":50}},{"date":"2026-09-15","rank":158,"change":{"type":"up","amount":79}},{"date":"2026-09-16","rank":144,"change":{"type":"up","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-09-17","rank":218,"change":{"type":"down","amount":74}},{"date":"2026-09-18","rank":267,"change":{"type":"down","amount":49}},{"date":"2026-09-22","rank":252,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-04","rank":137,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-05","rank":208,"change":{"type":"down","amount":71}},{"date":"2026-10-06","rank":141,"change":{"type":"up","amount":67}},{"date":"2026-10-07","rank":231,"change":{"type":"down","amount":90}},{"date":"2026-10-08","rank":273,"change":{"type":"down","amount":42}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-09-13","rank":270,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-14","rank":275,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-09-15","rank":268,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-09-16","rank":254,"change":{"type":"up","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-09-17","rank":248,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-09-18","rank":256,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-09-19","rank":262,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-09-20","rank":250,"change":{"type":"up","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-09-21","rank":253,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-